Referrer spam list (spammers.txt), from https://github.com/matomo-org/referrer-spam-list,
a community-contributed list maintained by Matomo.

The list's README says, under "License":

    Public Domain (no copyright).

Its composer.json declares the licence "CC0-1.0" (Creative Commons Zero v1.0
Universal, https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

Its README also says: "This list of Referrer spammers is contributed by the
community and is provided as is. Use at your own discretion: it may be
incomplete (although we aim to keep it up to date) and it may contain outdated
entries (let us know if a hostname was added but is not actually a spammer)."
